# React / TSX — condensed

Aligned with `.claude/rules/react-conventions.md` and coding-standards.

- **Complexity:** keep TSX branching within **cyclomatic complexity ≤ 11**; split sections or pure helpers before density hurts readability.
- **State/effects:** hooks for UI state; effects for real external sync — cleanup timers and subscriptions; avoid duplicating derive-able state.
- **Styling:** Tailwind utilities; match existing theme patterns; minimize ad-hoc inline styles.
- **Data:** flows through props and established loaders; persist domain behavior in `@minute-menus/supabase-service` per agents.md — not duplicated in leaves.
- **Shared UI:** use `@minute-menus/ui` and `@minute-menus/reels` before adding one-off loaders or reel markup in pages.

Full detail in `.claude/rules/react-conventions.md`.
- **Responsive:** every page, modal and toolbar must work from ~360px phones to desktop — mobile-first `sm:`/`md:` Tailwind, `flex-wrap` rows, labels collapse to icons on small screens (icon-only secondary actions with `aria-label`; icon + text from `sm:` up; tab strips/tables scroll in their own `overflow-x-auto` box), modals `max-h-full overflow-y-auto`. Check at phone width before finishing.
